# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage

# Tooling / runtime
.tmp/
*.log

# Harness output — regenerated by re-running the tool, never reviewed as a diff
tools/out/
tools/*/out/

# Renders, figures and probe shots. A picture taken to look at something is a reading rather than a result:
# the finding goes in docs/ beside the figure it produced and the image stays local. The one picture the app
# itself serves — wwwroot/favicon.png — was committed before this line and is unaffected, since an ignore
# never reaches a tracked file; a new one that genuinely belongs in the repo wants `git add -f`.
*.png

# Agent scratch — git worktrees an agent runner checks out beside the primary tree
.claude/

# Rider / VS Code
.idea/
.vscode/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
